@base = http://localhost:3030

### Salud
GET {{base}}/health

### Mapa de rutas
GET {{base}}/

### Catalogo con precios
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/services

### Motos
GET {{base}}/api/motorcycles

### Registrar moto
POST {{base}}/api/motorcycles
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plate": "KLM45C", "brand": "Suzuki", "model": "GN125", "year": 2019, "mileageKm": 34000, "ownerName": "Sofia Mena" }

### Crear orden de trabajo
POST {{base}}/api/work-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "motorcycleId": 1, "serviceCodes": ["OIL", "BRK"], "complaint": "frena mal y suena" }

### Avanzar estado
PATCH {{base}}/api/work-orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "diagnosing" }

### Factura (solo en ready o delivered)
GET {{base}}/api/work-orders/2/invoice
